"更新公告" = "What's New";
"本次更新" = "In This Update";
"• 新增 AI 修图与生图工具，内置一键美颜等快捷预设，激活码解锁后即可使用。\n• 新增树状分支文件库，支持嵌套分支、拖拽归类与持久化组织。\n• 新增专业非破坏性修图工具，提供光影 / 色彩 / 细节 / 效果 / 几何五组参数与透明预设。\n• 新增可展开的全屏二级相机参数面板，移动端保持紧凑触控区域。\n• USB/PTP 连接可靠性大幅提升：瞬时错误自动重试、HONOR 设备同步降级传输。\n• 视频录制监看延迟优化：子采样解码、管道重叠取帧、智能跳帧分析。" = "• Added AI photo editing and generation with one-tap beautify presets, unlocked via activation code.\n• Added nested branch library with drag-and-drop organization and persistent structure.\n• Added non-destructive image editor with Light / Color / Detail / Effects / Geometry adjustments and transparent presets.\n• Added expandable secondary full-screen camera parameter panel with compact mobile touch targets.\n• USB/PTP reliability: transient error auto-retry, synchronous fallback transport for HONOR devices.\n• Video monitoring latency: subsampled decode, overlapped frame pipeline, adaptive analysis skip.";
